idest\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 role badge\">\n                                CEO, NEXGEN SYSTEMS\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-medium leading-relaxed italic text-white/90\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 quote\">\n                                \"DS-Graphix didn't just design a website; they architected a growth engine. The collage energy and raw aesthetics fit our brand perfectly. Their process is brutal but brilliant.\"\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 author wrapper\">\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-[2px] bg-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 author line decoration\">\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"font-black uppercase text-xl tracking-widest text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 author name\">\n                                    Sarah Jenkins\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"brutalist-border border-white/20 p-12 relative group hover:border-[#FF6636] transition-colors bg-[#FF6636]/5\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 card\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -left-4 bg-[#FF6636] text-black px-6 py-2 font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 role badge\">\n                                PRODUCT HEAD, FLOW UI\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-medium leading-relaxed italic text-white/90\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 quote\">\n                                \"Sharp, brutal, and incredibly effective. Their proof is indeed in the work. Best agency experience we've had in a decade. Dhananjay's vision is unmatched.\"\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 author wrapper\">\n                                <div class=\"w-12 h-[2px] bg-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 author line decoration\">\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"font-black uppercase text-xl tracking-widest text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"2-2-4-1-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 author name\">\n                                    Dhananjay Chalke\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Footer CTA -->\n        <section class=\"bg-[#FF6636] py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden group\" data-kid=\"2-2-5\" data-name=\"footer call-to-action section\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto text-center relative z-10\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"footer call-to-action wrapper\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-black font-black text-6xl sm:text-[10rem] uppercase leading-[0.8] tracking-[-(0.05em)] mb-12 group-hover:tracking-normal transition-all duration-1000\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"footer cta headline\">\n                    Open the\n                    <br data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer cta headline break\"/>\n                    case files\n                </h2>\n                <a class=\"inline-block bg-black text-[#FF6636] px-16 py-6 font-black uppercase text-2xl brutalist-border border-black hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"footer cta button\" href=\"#\">\n                    Schedule Briefing\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Scrolling Ticker for background decoration -->\n            <div class=\"mt-20 flex overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap opacity-10\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"background scrolling ticker container\">\n                <div class=\"text-black font-black text-[15rem] uppercase leading-none select-none tracking-tighter animate-scroll\" data-kid=\"2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"scrolling text ticker\">\n                    UI/UX • BRANDING • STRATEGY • VIDEO • IDENTITY • UI/UX • BRANDING • STRATEGY • VIDEO • IDENTITY •\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Minimal Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"bg-black py-12 px-6 border-t-2 border-white/5\" data-kid=\"2-2-6\" data-name=\"minimal site footer\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"footer layout wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"text-[#FF6636] font-black text-2xl tracking-tighter uppercase\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">\n                    DS-Graphix\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-10\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"footer social links list\">\n                    <a class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer linkedin link\" href=\"#\">\n                        LinkedIn\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer behance link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Behance\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"footer instagram link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Instagram\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-white/40 hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-2-4\" data-name=\"footer twitter link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Twitter\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-white/20 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-2-6-1-3\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\">\n                    © 2024 DS-Graphix • All Rights Reserved\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n    <!-- Sticky WhatsApp Toggle -->\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 z-[100]\" data-kid=\"2-3\" data-name=\"whatsapp button container\">\n        <a class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#25D366] flex items-center justify-center rounded-none brutalist-border border-white hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp contact button\" href=\"#\">\n            <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 fill-white\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.438 9.889-9.886.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.89 4.44-9.892 9.886-.001 2.125.593 3.456 1.574 5.111l-.973 3.558 3.585-.939c.168.092.168.092 0 0zM12.006 18.01c-3.3 0-6-2.7-6-6 0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6 3.3 0 6 2.7 6 6 0 3.3-2.7 6-6 6z\">\n                </path>\n            </svg>\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\n    import Lenis from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1\"\n  \n  // Register GSAP plugins\n  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n  // Initialize Lenis smooth scroll\n  const lenis = new Lenis({\n    duration: 1.2,\n    easing: (t) => Math.min(1, 1.001 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t)),\n    smoothWheel: true,\n  });\n\n  function raf(time) {\n    lenis.raf(time);\n    requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(raf);\n\n  // Hero Entry Animation\n  gsap.from(\"#hero-text span\", {\n    y: 100,\n    opacity: 0,\n    duration: 1.5,\n    ease: \"expo.out\",\n    delay: 0.5\n  });\n\n  gsap.from(\"#hero-count\", {\n    y: 50,\n    opacity: 0,\n    duration: 1.2,\n    ease: \"power3.out\",\n    delay: 0.8\n  });\n\n  // Collage Parallax\n  const collageItems = document.querySelectorAll('.parallax-item');\n  collageItems.forEach(item => {\n    const speed = parseFloat(item.getAttribute('data-speed'));\n    \n    gsap.fromTo(item, \n      { y: 0 },\n      {\n        y: (speed * 150),\n        ease: \"none\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: item,\n          start: \"top bottom\",\n          end: \"bottom top\",\n          scrub: true\n        }\n      }\n    );\n  });\n\n  // Fade in cases + hover interaction\n  const cases = document.querySelectorAll('.collage-item');\n  cases.forEach(item => {\n    gsap.from(item, {\n      scale: 0.98,\n      opacity: 0,\n      duration: 1,\n      scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: item,\n        start: \"top 90%\",\n        toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n      }\n    });\n\n    item.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n      gsap.to(item, { scale: 1.02, zIndex: 60, duration: 0.4, ease: \"power2.out\" });\n    });\n    item.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n      gsap.to(item, { scale: 1, zIndex: item.classList.contains('z-40') ? 40 : (item.classList.contains('z-30') ? 30 : (item.classList.contains('z-20') ? 20 : 10)), duration: 0.4, ease: \"power2.out\" });\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Ticker Animation\n  gsap.to(\".animate-scroll\", {\n    xPercent: -50,\n    repeat: -1,\n    duration: 30,\n    ease: \"none\"\n  });\n\n  // Metrics entrance\n  gsap.from(\".proof-wall-metric\", {\n    x: -50,\n    opacity: 0,\n    stagger: 0.2,\n    duration: 1,\n    scrollTrigger: {\n      trigger: \".proof-wall-metric\",\n      start: \"top 80%\"\n    }\n  });\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-09T11:39:40.226396+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-09T11:39:40.226396+00:00",
      "id": "var_ea6dd40b381c"
    },
    "var_ebd5c0e075ba": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Systems-Led — Services",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 2760,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n    @import url('https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css');\n    @import url('https://unpkg.com/lenis@1/dist/lenis.css');\n\n    :root {\n        --color-bg: #F2F4F8;\n        --color-card: #FFFFFF;\n        --color-text: #2A2A29;\n        --color-accent: #FF6636;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;\n        background-color: var(--color-bg);\n        color: var(--color-text);\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .matrix-row:hover .row-action {\n        background-color: var(--color-accent);\n        color: white;\n        border-color: var(--color-accent);\n    }\n\n    .matrix-row, .bento-card, .hero-btn {\n        transition: none !important;\n    }\n\n    /* Custom Scrollbar */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n        width: 8px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n        background: var(--color-bg);\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n        background: #D1D5DB;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n        background: #9CA3AF;\n    }\n\n    .bento-card:hover {\n        transform: translateY(-4px);\n    }\n\n    /* GSAP reveal targets initial state (not hidden with opacity 0 to follow guidelines) */\n    .reveal-item {\n        /* Handled by GSAP .from() */\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"selection:bg-[#FF6636]/30 selection:text-[#2A2A29]\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\">\n    <!-- Navbar -->\n    <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full px-6 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"main navigation header\">\n        <nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-[#2A2A29]/5 rounded-2xl px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-8 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation bar container\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo and branding container\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#FF6636] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-[#FF6636]/20\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo icon container\">\n                    <span class=\"text-white font-extrabold text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo text\">\n                        DS\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand identity name and subtext container\">\n                    <span class=\"font-bold text-[#2A2A29] tracking-tight text-lg leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                        DS-Graphix\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#2A2A29]/40 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand tagline\">\n                        Services Overview\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Search Bar -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex flex-1 max-w-xl relative\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"search bar wrapper\">\n                <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#2A2A29]/30\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"search magnifying glass icon\">\n                </i>\n                <input class=\"w-full bg-[#F2F4F8] border-none rounded-xl py-2.5 pl-11 pr-4 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#FF6636]/10 outline-none placeholder:text-[#2A2A29]/30 font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"search input field\" placeholder=\"Search service, milestone or ship-log...\" type=\"text\"/>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"navigation link and cta group\">\n                <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"navigation menu links container\">\n                    <a class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2A2A29]/40 hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"case studies link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Case Studies\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"capabilities link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Capabilities\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2A2A29]/40 hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"contact link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Contact\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"bg-[#2A2A29] text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#FF6636] transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-lg shadow-[#2A2A29]/10 active:scale-95\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"get-started call-to-action button\">\n                    Get Started\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n    <main data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n        <!-- Hero Section: Rebuilt as Split Dashboard Bento -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero content text container\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#FF6636]/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status pill container\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF6636] animate-pulse\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status pulse indicator\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[#FF6636] font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"status label text\">\n                        Service Catalog 2026\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black text-[#2A2A29] tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero main headline\">\n                    Choose the\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    right creative\n                    <span class=\"text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"headline accent word\">\n                        lever.\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"text-xl text-[#2A2A29]/60 max-w-lg leading-relaxed mb-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                    A systems-led framework for digital growth. We build the high-fidelity foundations that turn users into advocates.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"hero call-to-action buttons container\">\n                    <a class=\"hero-btn w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#2A2A29] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm shadow-xl shadow-[#2A2A29]/20 hover:bg-[#FF6636] text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"discovery audit primary button\" href=\"#\">\n                        Start a Discovery Audit\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"hero-btn w-full sm:w-auto bg-white border border-[#2A2A29]/10 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm shadow-sm hover:border-[#FF6636]/30 text-center\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"capability matrix secondary button\" href=\"#matrix\">\n                        Explore Capability Matrix\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Dashboard Hero Element -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"dashboard hero visualization grid\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#2A2A29]/5 shadow-sm col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"performance graph card\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"graph header container\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2A2A29]/40\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"graph title text\">\n                            Active Performance\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"graph status indicators container\">\n                            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"active status dot\">\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-200\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"inactive status dot\">\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <img alt=\"Performance Graph\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl grayscale\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"performance graph image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1625296276703-3fbc924f07b5?auto=format&w=800&q=80\"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-[#2A2A29] p-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/5 shadow-xl text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"milestone speed card\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"milestone card title\">\n                        Milestone Speed\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-black mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"milestone value\">\n                        48h\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] opacity-40\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"milestone description\">\n                        Initial Ship Log\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#2A2A29]/5 shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"client roi card\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2A2A29]/40 mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"roi card title\">\n                        Client ROI\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"roi percentage value\">\n                        +40%\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-[#2A2A29]/40 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"roi description\">\n                        Retention spike\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Feature Matrix Section -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mb-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature matrix section\" id=\"matrix\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-[#2A2A29]/5 border border-[#2A2A29]/5 overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"matrix card container\">\n                <!-- Header: Improved Contrast and Size -->\n                <div class=\"hidden md:grid grid-cols-12 bg-[#F2F4F8] border-b border-[#2A2A29]/5 py-6 px-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"matrix header row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-span-4 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#2A2A29]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"matrix header title: service layer\">\n                        Service Layer\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-span-3 text-[1