\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"author title\">\n                                    Chief Digital Officer, Global Mfg.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"final cta text container\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-[#2A2A29] leading-[0.95] mb-8 tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"cta headline\">\n                        Ready to pull the lever?\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg text-[#2A2A29]/50 mb-10 max-w-md\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"cta sub-description\">\n                        Our intake is currently open for Q3 projects. Start a brief discovery to get a custom roadmap in 24 hours.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3\" data-name=\"cta buttons container\">\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#FF6636] text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-xl shadow-[#FF6636]/20 cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"quote button\">\n                            Get a Custom Quote\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#2A2A29] text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-[#FF6636] transition-all cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"portfolio button\">\n                            View Portfolio\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-[#2A2A29]/5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-12 opacity-30 grayscale\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"social proof logos container\">\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-[#2A2A29]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"logo: transunion\">\n                    TRANSUNION\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-[#2A2A29]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"logo: vodafone\">\n                    VODAFONE\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-[#2A2A29]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"logo: hitachi\">\n                    HITACHI\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-[#2A2A29]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-4\" data-name=\"logo: paypal\">\n                    PAYPAL\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#2A2A29] py-20 px-6 text-white overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-16 mb-20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer main grid\">\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer contact info container\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo container\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#FF6636] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo icon\">\n                        <span class=\"text-white font-black text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo initials\">\n                            DS\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"font-black text-2xl tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">\n                        DS-Graphix\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-white/40 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                    Full-service digital architecture and creative solutions for businesses that run at high stakes.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-6 mt-10\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"social media icons container\">\n                    <a class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-[#FF6636] hover:border-[#FF6636] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"linkedin icon container\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"linkedin icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-[#FF6636] hover:border-[#FF6636] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"instagram icon container\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-brands fa-instagram\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"instagram icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-[#FF6636] hover:border-[#FF6636] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"behance icon container\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"fa-brands fa-behance\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"behance icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"footer capabilities link list\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/20 mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"capabilities header\">\n                    Capabilities\n                </h4>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm font-bold text-white/60\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"links container\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"link container\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"ui/ux design link\" href=\"#\">\n                            UI/UX Design\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"link container\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"brand identity link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Brand Identity\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"link container\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"social strategy link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Social Strategy\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"link container\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"video production link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Video Production\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"footer direct contact container\">\n                <h4 class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/20 mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"contact header\">\n                    Direct Contact\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white/60 mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"email address text\">\n                    hello@ds-graphix.com\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white/60 mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"phone number text\">\n                    +91 98903 88405\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-white/5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-4\" data-name=\"office location card\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white/20 mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"office label\">\n                        Office\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"office address text\">\n                        Baner Rd, Aundh, Pune, Maharashtra 411007\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-10 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer legal bottom bar\">\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white/20 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"copyright notice\">\n                © 2024 DS-Graphix Studio. All Rights Reserved.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-8 text-[10px] font-bold text-white/20 uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"legal links container\">\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"privacy policy link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Privacy Policy\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"terms of service link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Terms of Service\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n    <!-- WhatsApp FAB -->\n    <a class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 w-16 h-16 bg-[#25D366] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl shadow-2xl shadow-[#25D366]/40 hover:scale-110 transition-transform z-[100]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"whatsapp call-to-action button\" href=\"#\">\n        <i class=\"fa-brands fa-whatsapp\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp icon\">\n        </i>\n    </a>\n</div>\n<!-- Scripts -->\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\n    import Lenis from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1\"\n    \n    // Smooth Scroll\n    const lenis = new Lenis()\n    function raf(time) {\n        lenis.raf(time)\n        requestAnimationFrame(raf)\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(raf)\n\n    // Hero Reveal\n    gsap.from(\"h1, .hero-btn, p\", {\n        opacity: 0,\n        y: 40,\n        duration: 1,\n        stagger: 0.1,\n        ease: \"power4.out\"\n    });\n\n    // Matrix Rows Reveal\n    gsap.from(\".matrix-row\", {\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \"#matrix\",\n            start: \"top 80%\",\n        },\n        opacity: 0,\n        y: 30,\n        stagger: 0.15,\n        duration: 0.8,\n        ease: \"power3.out\"\n    });\n\n    // Bento Cards Reveal\n    gsap.from(\".bento-card\", {\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \".bento-card\",\n            start: \"top 85%\",\n        },\n        opacity: 0,\n        scale: 0.95,\n        stagger: 0.2,\n        duration: 1,\n        ease: \"back.out(1.7)\"\n    });\n\n    // Audit Panel Reveal\n    gsap.from(\".audit-panel-content\", {\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \".audit-panel\",\n            start: \"top 75%\",\n        },\n        opacity: 0,\n        x: -50,\n        duration: 1,\n        ease: \"power3.out\"\n    });\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-09T11:39:40.097694+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-09T11:39:40.097694+00:00",
      "id": "var_ebd5c0e075ba"
    },
    "var_448c969296da": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Editorial Premium — Contact & Quote",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 4140,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-white text-[#2A2A29] font-['DM_Sans'] selection:bg-[#FF6636]/20 selection:text-[#FF6636] overflow-x-clip\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\">\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,100..900;1,9..144,100..900&display=swap');\n        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css');\n        @import url('https://unpkg.com/lenis@1/dist/lenis.css');\n\n        .form-input:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: #FF6636;\n        }\n\n        .editorial-line {\n            height: 1px;\n            background-color: rgba(42, 42, 41, 0.1);\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom scrollbar for better aesthetics */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 6px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #F2F4F8;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #2A2A29;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: #FF6636;\n        }\n    </style>\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"border-b border-[#2A2A29]/10 px-6 md:px-12 py-6 flex justify-between items-center bg-white sticky top-0 z-[100]\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"header navigation bar\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-12\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo and menu container\">\n            <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter hover:text-[#FF6636] cursor-pointer transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo text\">\n                DS-GRAPHIX\n                <span class=\"text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo accent dot\">\n                    .\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex gap-10 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main navigation menu\">\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"services link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Services\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"work link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Work\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"process link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Process\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"insights link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Insights\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"header actions container\">\n            <button class=\"text-[#2A2A29]/60 hover:text-[#FF6636] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"search button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-search text-xl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"search icon\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <a class=\"bg-[#FF6636] text-white px-8 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-[#2A2A29] transition-colors rounded-none\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"get a quote action button\" href=\"#contact\">\n                Get a Quote\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-24 md:py-40\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n            <div class=\"hero-container\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero content wrapper\">\n                <p class=\"hero-eyebrow text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-bold text-[#FF6636] mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero eyebrow text\">\n                    Let's Talk Business\n                </p>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-headline font-['Fraunces'] text-6xl md:text-[140px] leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter max-w-5xl mb-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero headline text\">\n                    Let’s make the\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero headline line break\"/>\n                    next move\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero headline line break\"/>\n                    <span class=\"italic text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero headline emphasis text\">\n                        visible.\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n                <div class=\"hero-line editorial-line w-40 h-1 bg-[#2A2A29] mt-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"hero decorative line\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- Split Form Section -->\n        <section class=\"border-t border-[#2A2A29]/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"contact section\" id=\"contact\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"split layout container\">\n                <!-- Left: Context Panel -->\n                <div class=\"w-full lg:w-5/12 bg-[#F2F4F8] p-8 md:p-16 lg:p-24 border-r border-[#2A2A29]/10 flex flex-col justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"context panel\">\n                    <div class=\"gsap-reveal-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"reveal animation container\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"header container\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold text-[#2A2A29]/40 block mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"contact eyebrow label\">\n                                Contact & Support\n                            </span>\n                            <h2 class=\"font-['Fraunces'] text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section headline text\">\n                                Design is a strategy,\n                                <br data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"section headline line break\"/>\n                                not just an aesthetic.\n                            </h2>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"info stack container\">\n                            <div class=\"border-l border-[#FF6636] pl-8 py-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial card\">\n                                <p class=\"text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#2A2A29]/80 font-['Fraunces'] italic\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"testimonial quote text\">\n                                    \"Every great partnership begins with a clear objective. We bridge the gap between business goals and user delight.\"\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"testimonial author container\">\n                                    <img alt=\"Dhananjay Chalke\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-none grayscale\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial author profile image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/100?u=dhananjay\"/>\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial author details\">\n                                        <p class=\"font-bold uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial author name\">\n                                            Dhananjay Chalke\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#2A2A29]/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial author title\">\n                                            Founder, DS-Graphix\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"space-y-10 pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"contact info list\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"inquiries container\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-[#2A2A29]/40 mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"inquiries label\">\n                                        Inquiries\n                                    </p>\n                                    <a class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium border-b border-[#2A2A29]/10 hover:border-[#FF6636] transition-colors pb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"inquiries email link\" href=\"mailto:hello@ds-graphix.com\">\n                                        hello@ds-graphix.com\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"response promise container\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-[#2A2A29]/40 mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"response promise label\">\n                                        Response Promise\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-lg text-[#2A2A29]/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"response promise text\">\n                                        Expect a detailed response within 24 business hours. We value your time as much as your vision.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"global hubs container\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-[#2A2A29]/40 mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"global hubs label\">\n                                        Global Hubs\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-lg text-[#2A2A29]/70\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"global hubs text\">\n                                        Operating from Pune, India — delivering worldwide solutions to high-growth brands.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-24 gsap-reveal-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"location and social container\">\n                        <!-- Location/Map Marker Editorial Integration -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full border-y border-[#2A2A29]/10 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 group cursor-pointer transition-all duration-500\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"location card\">\n                            <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#2A2A29] flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-[#FF6636] transition-colors duration-500 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"location icon background\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-2xl text-white transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"location icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"location address text container\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-2 text-[#FF6636]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-1-2-1\" 