 a 20-minute strategic discovery call to see if our methodology aligns with your growth targets.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"cta button container\">\n                <a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-[var(--color-dark)] px-16 py-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-black hover:bg-[var(--color-dark)] hover:text-white transition-all duration-500 sharp-corner\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-1\" data-name=\"primary discovery call button\" href=\"#\">\n                    Book Discovery Call\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-white py-24 px-6 border-t border-[var(--color-dark)]/10\" data-kid=\"1-7\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\" data-name=\"footer grid container\">\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-1 space-y-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand block\">\n                <div class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                    DS-Graphix\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-dark)]/60 max-w-xs\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand mission statement\">\n                    A full-service creative agency architecting digital futures through superior design and surgical strategy.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation link group\">\n                <h5 class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-black text-[var(--color-dark)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"group header\">\n                    Navigation\n                </h5>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"navigation link list\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Work\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Services\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"text-[var(--color-orange)]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Process\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                            About\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"connection link group\">\n                <h5 class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-black text-[var(--color-dark)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1\" data-name=\"group header\">\n                    Connect\n                </h5>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2\" data-name=\"connection link list\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"connection link\" href=\"#\">\n                            LinkedIn\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"connection link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Behance\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"connection link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Instagram\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-orange)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"connection link\" href=\"#\">\n                            WhatsApp\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4\" data-name=\"legal link group\">\n                <h5 class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-black text-[var(--color-dark)]/40\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1\" data-name=\"group header\">\n                    Legal\n                </h5>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-sm font-bold text-[var(--color-dark)]/50\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2\" data-name=\"legal link list\">\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-dark)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"legal link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Privacy Policy\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-dark)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"legal link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Terms of Service\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"list item\">\n                        <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--color-dark)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"legal link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Cookie Settings\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-light)] flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6 text-[var(--color-dark)]/30 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-black\" data-kid=\"1-7-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom section\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"copyright notice text\">\n                © 2026 DS-Graphix Creative Agency\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"footer tagline\">\n                Designed for Excellence\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script type=\"module\">\n    import Lenis from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1\"\n  import Snap from \"https://esm.sh/lenis@1/snap\"\n  \n  // Initialize Lenis\n  const lenis = new Lenis()\n  function raf(time) {\n    lenis.raf(time)\n    requestAnimationFrame(raf)\n  }\n  requestAnimationFrame(raf)\n\n  // Initialize GSAP\n  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n  // Hero Animations\n  const tlHero = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\", duration: 1.5 } });\n  tlHero.from(\".hero-text\", { y: 100, opacity: 0, skewY: 5 })\n        .from(\".hero-line\", { scaleX: 0, transformOrigin: \"left center\" }, \"-=1\")\n        .from(\".hero-index div\", { y: 20, opacity: 0, stagger: 0.1 }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n  // Process Steps Reveal\n  gsap.utils.toArray(\".process-step\").forEach((step, i) => {\n    const tl = gsap.timeline({\n      scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: step,\n        start: \"top 85%\",\n        toggleActions: \"play none none none\"\n      }\n    });\n    \n    tl.from(step.querySelector(\".step-number\"), { x: -40, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.out\" })\n      .from(step.querySelector(\".step-title\"), { y: 40, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.out\" }, \"-=1\")\n      .from(step.querySelector(\"p\"), { y: 30, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: \"power2.out\" }, \"-=1\")\n      .from(step.querySelectorAll(\"ul li\"), { \n        y: 20, \n        opacity: 0, \n        stagger: 0.15, \n        duration: 0.8, \n        ease: \"power2.out\" \n      }, \"-=0.8\")\n      .from(step.querySelector(\"img\"), { scale: 1.05, opacity: 0, duration: 1.5, ease: \"power2.out\" }, \"-=1.2\");\n  });\n\n  // Communication Items\n  gsap.from(\".communication-item\", {\n    scrollTrigger: {\n      trigger: \"section.bg-\\\\[var\\\\(--color-dark\\\\)\\\\]\",\n      start: \"top 80%\"\n    },\n    y: 40,\n    opacity: 0,\n    stagger: 0.15,\n    duration: 1.2,\n    ease: \"power3.out\"\n  });\n\n  // Parallax for process images\n  gsap.utils.toArray(\".process-step img\").forEach(img => {\n    gsap.to(img, {\n      scrollTrigger: {\n        trigger: img,\n        start: \"top bottom\",\n        end: \"bottom top\",\n        scrub: true\n      },\n      y: -60,\n      ease: \"none\"\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n<link data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"icon font stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<link data-kid=\"3\" data-name=\"lenis scroll stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/lenis@1/dist/lenis.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-09T11:39:40.419900+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-09T11:39:40.419900+00:00",
      "id": "var_6825683b1b7a"
    },
    "var_bddd49f09079": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Editorial Premium — Home",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 15180,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,100..900;1,9..144,100..900&display=swap');\n  @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css');\n  @import url('https://unpkg.com/lenis@1/dist/lenis.css');\n\n  :root {\n    --color-orange: #FF6636;\n    --color-dark: #2A2A29;\n    --color-white: #FFFFFF;\n    --color-light-gray: #F2F4F8;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n    color: var(--color-dark);\n    background-color: var(--color-white);\n    overflow-x: clip; /* For sticky and to prevent horizontal scroll */\n  }\n\n  .font-serif {\n    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;\n  }\n\n  .sharp {\n    border-radius: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .text-outline {\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--color-dark);\n    color: transparent;\n  }\n\n  /* Custom Marquee */\n  @keyframes marquee {\n    0% { transform: translateX(0); }\n    100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }\n  }\n  .animate-marquee {\n    animation: marquee 30s linear infinite;\n  }\n\n  /* Utilities */\n  .border-dark { border-color: var(--color-dark); }\n  .bg-orange { background-color: var(--color-orange); }\n  .text-orange { color: var(--color-orange); }\n</style>\n<!-- Navigation -->\n<header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 bg-white border-b border-[var(--color-dark)] h-20 flex items-center\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"main header navigation\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto w-full px-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"navigation container\">\n        <div class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter font-serif\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo text\">\n            DS-Graphix\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-10 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"main navigation links\">\n            <a class=\"hover:text-orange transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"work navigation link\" href=\"#work\">\n                Work\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-orange transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"services navigation link\" href=\"#services\">\n                Services\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-orange transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"process navigation link\" href=\"#process\">\n                Process\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-orange transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"about navigation link\" href=\"#about\">\n                About\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"hover:text-orange transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"insights navigation link\" href=\"#insights\">\n                Insights\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"header utility container\">\n            <button class=\"text-xl hover:text-orange transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"search button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"search icon\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <a class=\"bg-orange text-white text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-black px-8 py-4 sharp hover:bg-[var(--color-dark)] transition-all\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"discovery call call-to-action button\" href=\"#contact\">\n                Book a discovery call\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n<main class=\"pt-20\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-24 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n        <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-end relative\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero content grid\">\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-8 animate-reveal\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero text column\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-6xl lg:text-[10rem] leading-[0.8] font-black tracking-tighter font-serif mb-16\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero headline\">\n                    Design that makes good businesses\n                    <span class=\"italic font-light\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero headline italic emphasis\">\n                        impossible to ignore.\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 items-start\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero sub-content container\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-md border-l border-dark pl-10 py-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero description wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl text-[var(--color-dark)] opacity-70 leading-relaxed font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                            A high-end editorial approach to digital transformation. We build visual authority for industry pioneers.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"inline-block bg-orange text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] font-black px-14 py-7 sharp hover:bg-dark transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"primary call-to-action button\" href=\"#work\">\n                        Start a project\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 relative animate-reveal overflow-hidden group\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero image wrapper\">\n                <img alt=\"Architectural detail by Ricardo Gomez Angel\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero decorative image\" data-scroll=\"\" data-scroll-speed=\"0.05\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486718448742-163732cd1544?auto=format&w=800&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-dark/10 pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero image border overlay\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- Credibility Row -->\n    <section class=\"bg-dark text-white border-y border-dark\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"credibility metrics section\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 border-l border-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"metrics grid container\">\n            <div class=\"animate-reveal p-12 lg:p-16 border-r border-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"years in design metric\">\n                <div class=\"text-6xl font-serif mb-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"years in design value\">\n                    12+\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-40 font-black\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"years in design label\">\n                    Years in Design\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"animate-reveal p-12 lg:p-16 border-r border-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"launches completed metric\">\n                <div class=\"text-6xl font-serif mb-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"launches completed value\">\n                    140+\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-40 font-black\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"launches completed label\">\n                    Launches Completed\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"animate-reveal p-12 lg:p-16 border-r border-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"markets reached metric\">\n                <div class=\"text-6xl font-serif mb-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"markets reached value\">\n                    36\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-40 font-black\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"markets reached label\">\n                    Markets Reached\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"animate-reveal p-12 lg:p-16 border-r border-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"partner rating metric\">\n                <div class=\"text-6xl font-serif mb-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"partner rating value\">\n                    4.9/5\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-40 font-black\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"partner rating label\">\n                    Partner Rating\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- Logo Marquee -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 border-b border-dark/10 overflow-hidden bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-3\" data-name=\"logo marquee section\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-32 whitespace-nowrap animate-marquee\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\" data-name=\"marquee content container\">\n            <span class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"client logo monsoonfish\">\n                Monsoonfish\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"client logo yuj designs\">\n                Yuj Designs\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"client logo avis global\">\n                Avis Global\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-4\" data-name=\"client logo transunion\">\n                TransUnion\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-5\" data-name=\"client logo taxbuddy inc\">\n                TaxBuddy Inc.\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-6\" data-name=\"client logo operabase\">\n                Operabase\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-7\" data-name=\"client logo trmeric co\">\n                Trmeric Co.\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-8\" data-name=\"client logo livedx labs\">\n                LivedX Labs\n            </span>\n            <!-- Duplicate for marquee -->\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-9\" data-name=\"client logo monsoonfish repeat\">\n                Monsoonfish\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-10\" data-name=\"client logo yuj designs repeat\">\n                Yuj Designs\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-11\" data-name=\"client logo avis global repeat\">\n                Avis Global\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-12\" data-name=\"client logo transunion repeat\">\n                TransUnion\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-13\" data-name=\"client logo taxbuddy inc repeat\">\n                TaxBuddy Inc.\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight opacity-20 grayscale\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-14\" data-name=\"client logo operabase repeat\">\n                Operabase\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-40 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-24 border-b border-dark/10\" data-kid=\"2-4\" data-name=\"services section\" id=\"services\">\n        <!-- Sticky Index -->\n        <aside class=\"lg:w-1/4\" data-kid=\"2-4-1\" data-name=\"sticky index sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"sticky top-40\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"capabilities sticky wrapper\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.5em] font-black mb-16 opacity-30\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"capabilities heading\">\n                    Capabilities\n                </h2>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-10 text-4xl font-serif\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"capabilities list\">\n                    <li class=\"text-orange flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"ui ux design link\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold opacity-40\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"ui ux index number\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"ui ux index text\">\n                            UI/UX Design\n                        </span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"opacity-20 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand identity link\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-sans font-bold opacity-40\" data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"brand identity index number\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-4-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"brand identity index text\">\n                            Brand Identity\n       